# A trailing comma before `|`: DS0127 with a fix that removes it.
mode: syntax
---- query
from 'orders.csv' | project amount, customerId, | take 5
---- expected
PROGRAM@0..57
  PIPELINE@0..56
    IDENT@0..4 "from"
    WHITESPACE@4..5 " "
    LITERAL@5..17
      STRING@5..17 "'orders.csv'"
    WHITESPACE@17..18 " "
    PIPE@18..19 "|"
    WHITESPACE@19..20 " "
    PROJECT_OP@20..47
      IDENT@20..27 "project"
      WHITESPACE@27..28 " "
      NAMED_EXPR@28..34
        NAME_REF@28..34
          IDENT@28..34 "amount"
      COMMA@34..35 ","
      WHITESPACE@35..36 " "
      NAMED_EXPR@36..46
        NAME_REF@36..46
          IDENT@36..46 "customerId"
      COMMA@46..47 ","
    WHITESPACE@47..48 " "
    PIPE@48..49 "|"
    WHITESPACE@49..50 " "
    TAKE_OP@50..56
      IDENT@50..54 "take"
      WHITESPACE@54..55 " "
      LITERAL@55..56
        LONG@55..56 "5"
  WHITESPACE@56..57 "\n"

error[DS0127]: trailing `,` before `|`
  --> query:1:47
  |
1 | from 'orders.csv' | project amount, customerId, | take 5
  |                                               ^ nothing follows this `,` in the list
  |
  = help: remove the `,`

with the machine-applicable fixes applied:
    from 'orders.csv' | project amount, customerId | take 5
which parses without errors
